Unsupported JSON Schema structure {"description":"JSONSchemaPropsOrBool represents JSONSchemaProps or a boolean value. Defaults to true for the boolean property."} 
Make sure it is valid to the JSON Schema specification and check if it's supported by Outlines.
If it should be supported, please open an issue.

